ctions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4891360611/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"off-topic"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4891380334","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120959#issuecomment-4891380334","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120959","id":4891380334,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABI4yKbg","user":{"login":"HackingRepo","id":173050347,"node_id":"U_kgDOClCJ6w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/173050347?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HackingRepo","html_url":"https://github.com/HackingRepo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HackingRepo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HackingRepo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HackingRepo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HackingRepo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HackingRepo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HackingRepo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HackingRepo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HackingRepo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HackingRepo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-06T09:47:52Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T09:48:03Z","body":"now everything, good","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4891380334/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4959881658","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120959#issuecomment-4959881658","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120959","id":4959881658,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABJ6HJug","user":{"login":"mihe","id":4884246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4ODQyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4884246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe","html_url":"https://github.com/mihe","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mihe/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-13T15:54:02Z","updated_at":"2026-07-13T15:54:43Z","body":"This is the \"intended\" behavior, but it is indeed a discrepancy from how Godot Physics behaves.\n\nThe problem is simply that applying a force/torque to the body means applying it to the underlying Jolt body, which doesn't exist until the node has actually entered a scene tree (i.e. `_ready`) and been assigned a physics space (i.e. a Jolt `PhysicsSystem`).\n\nI don't think it would be particularly difficult to fix this, but it would make the code a little bit messier, and come at a slight memory cost for non-entered nodes, so I opted for this error instead, to see if anyone would complain about it, and I believe this is the first mention of it in the three years that it's been there, so I'm tempted to say we should just keep it as-is.\n\nIt might perhaps deserve a note in the documentation.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4959881658/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]